OL,3,GNEWSARAF veteran 'saved' by new blood
OL,4,Acancer treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA veteran Royal Air Force engineer from
OL,7,FDerbyshire has said he "owes his life"
OL,8,Fto a new treatment that helped him
OL,9,Frecover from an aggressive form of
OL,10,Fblood cancer.
OL,12,FTim Swinburn, from Codnor Park, is one
OL,13,Fof the first patients in England to
OL,14,Freceive STARGLO - a treatment from the
OL,15,FNHS for diffuse large B-cell lymphoma,
OL,16,Fthe most common and aggressive type of
OL,17,Fnon-Hodgkin lymphoma.
OL,19,FSwinburn said he was "seriously running
OL,20,Fout of options" when he was offered the
OL,21,Ftherapy.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
